<title>UK: Wet Brent trades firmer at March +28 cents.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades firmer at March +28 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brent cargo nominated from the paper chains on Monday and clocked to a major traded on Tuesday morning at March Brent +28 cents, traders said.</p>
<p>The deal for the Feb 4-6 loader is firmer than recent traded levels for physical Brent. A Feb 1-3 cargo traded on Monday at March Brent +13 cents.</p>
<p>-- Rosalind Russell, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
